TRAIT_model &lt;- lmer(TRAIT ~ 1 + (1|MTurkCode) + (1|StimNum) + (1|country) + (1|country*StimNum) + (1|region) + (1|region*StimNum), data=data)

TRAIT = {Competent, Capable, Warm, Friendly, Honest, Reliable, Dominant, Attractive}

***NOTE: This model does not include an MTurkCode*StimNum (i.e., perceiver-by-target) ICC because estimating this ICC requires two observations for each perceiver-by-target combination.***
